<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em">Zig Zag's Top Shelf quality paper cones in a size to meet your on-the-go quick hitter customer's needs.</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em">We have these cones available in ultra-thin and unbleached &amp; three different package counts.</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em">· 8 Cones Per Pack</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em">· 24 Cones Per Pack</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:1em">· 800 Cone Bulk Pack</p>
<p style="margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0; margin-right:0; margin-top:0; padding-bottom:0">If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me at the number below.</p></div>
